---
import { affiliateLinks } from "../../../data/affiliateLinks";
---

<section class="bg-gradient-to-b from-white to-blue-50 py-24">

<div class="mx-auto max-w-6xl px-6">

<div class="rounded-3xl border bg-white p-12 shadow-xl">

<div class="text-center">

<span class="rounded-full bg-green-100 px-4 py-2 text-sm font-semibold text-green-700">
🏆 Final Verdict
</span>

<h2 class="mt-6 text-5xl font-extrabold">
Should You Buy Canva Pro?
</h2>

<p class="mx-auto mt-8 max-w-4xl text-xl leading-9 text-gray-700">

After spending dozens of hours testing Canva AI across graphic design,
presentations, AI writing, image generation, social media content and video
creation, we confidently recommend Canva Pro for almost every content creator.

</p>

<p class="mx-auto mt-6 max-w-4xl text-lg leading-8 text-gray-600">

The platform combines professional design tools with powerful AI features in
one incredibly simple interface. Instead of paying for multiple subscriptions,
Canva AI gives you writing, design, image generation, presentations,
background removal, collaboration and video editing under one roof.

</p>

</div>

<div class="mt-16 grid gap-10 md:grid-cols-2">

<div>

<h3 class="text-2xl font-bold">
Why We Recommend Canva AI
</h3>

<ul class="mt-6 space-y-4 text-lg">

<li>✅ Outstanding value for money</li>

<li>✅ Extremely beginner friendly</li>

<li>✅ Excellent AI tools</li>

<li>✅ Huge template library</li>

<li>✅ Great collaboration features</li>

<li>✅ Saves hours every week</li>

</ul>

</div>

<div>

<h3 class="text-2xl font-bold">
Overall CreatorStack Score
</h3>

<div class="mt-8 rounded-3xl bg-blue-600 p-10 text-center text-white">

<div class="text-7xl font-extrabold">
4.9
</div>

<div class="mt-2 text-xl">
⭐⭐⭐⭐⭐
</div>

<p class="mt-4">
One of the best AI design platforms available in 2026.
</p>

</div>

</div>

</div>

<div class="mt-16 rounded-3xl bg-green-50 p-10 text-center">

<h3 class="text-3xl font-bold">
🎉 Exclusive CreatorStack Offer
</h3>

<p class="mt-6 text-xl">

Get <strong>50% OFF your first 3 months</strong> when you sign up using our
exclusive Canva partner link.

</p>

<a

href={affiliateLinks.canva}

target="_blank"

rel="nofollow sponsored noopener"

onclick="trackAffiliateClick('Canva AI','Final Verdict')"

class="mt-10 inline-flex rounded-2xl bg-green-600 px-10 py-5 text-xl font-bold text-white transition hover:scale-105 hover:bg-green-700"

>

🚀 Claim Your 50% Discount

</a>

</div>

</div>

</div>

</section>